<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">Vidunda Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yuda</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa ya Yuda iwhana na itagwa lya yandiche. Yuda kangizelesa yuye kota ka mng'holoze Yakubu, mng'holoze Yesu. Ahyo, ayu Yuda kahi kangukundigwa kota mng'holoze Yesu (Yuda 1). Hatuvizelele kota baluwa ayi nayandichigwa kwa chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ama kota vyoilingulonjigwa mli Ilagano lya Katali yangoneka wasomile baluwa ya Yuda wenji nawali Wayahudi. Heye nakandika baluwa ayi kwa, “Weng'ha wachemigwe na Nguluwi na waganigwe na Nguluwi Mhaza na kuwichigwa goya kwa chiwalo cha Yesu Kilistu.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa ayi nayandichigwa kuli mhela wa makumi sita (60) Yesu loyavumbuche. Chiwalo cha kwandika baluwa kwa weng'ha walingumkunda Kilistu ndo kuwakanya hewo kuli kulongozwa vibi na walangusa wa udesi (Yuda 4). Nakalavya honhu halingiwhana kuli usenga na madito nagalawile mli Ilagano lya Katali na kikangaza kuli kitwanza. Baluwa yangiwhana na kumema ulonzi uwele mli baluwa ya 2 Petili, imemile makanyo galinguwala walangusa wa udesi (Yuda 4 na 2 Petili 2:1). Vivyo du na ukumbuso wanguwawala wahilisi na miji ja Sodoma na Gomola.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Yuda tandi kanguwalamsa walingusoma (Yuda 1:1-2).</para>
  <para style="io">2. Hamba, kangulonga chiwalo cha kwandika na kuwakanya kiyusa na walangusa wa udesi (Yuda 1:3-4).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Hamba kanguwakanya wala walingusoma kukolela mbuli ziwalawile wanhu kuli Ilagano lya Katali (Yuda 1:5-16).</para>
  <para style="io">4. Hamba kanguwalonjela hewo choni chowedichile kuli gala yawakanyile (Yuda 1:17-23).</para>
  <para style="io">5. Hamba kangugongomanya baluwa ya heye kwa kumtogola Nguluwi (Yuda 1:24-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Heni nda Yuda, chitumagwa wa Yesu Kilistu na mng'holoze Yakubu, ndanguwandichilani hemwe mchemigwe na Nguluwi na muwelengikala kuli igano lya Nguluwi Mhaza, na kwamilwa na Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Ndangukuganilani isungu na kikala goya na igano kulawa kwa Nguluwi viwe na hemwe.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walangusa wa udesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Wang'holozangu, nandali na majesa ga kuwandichilani kwa chiwalo cha wula ulohozi wotuwele hamwe, ila yanguganigwa ndiwandichile mlutilile na ibamba kwa chiwalo cha makundo gala Nguluwi yawapele wanhu wa heye kamwe hela kwa mhela weng'ha. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Mina wanhu wohawamzelele Nguluwi wapegwa kiyinjiza kwa uviso hali hetwe, wanhu wawele, kwa chiwalo cha kupegwa lufufu kulawa kuli ukomu wa hewo wihile, wagalusa usenga wa isungu lya Nguluwi wa hetwe na kumbeza Yesu Kilistu yawele yaliyeng'ha Chilongozi na Mkulu wa hetwe. Ila, Maandiko Matakatifu nagalonga kulawa katali, utaguso ulinguwabeta wanhu awo.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Lelo ndangugana kuwakumbusani, hanga aga namina mlonjelwa ulonzi awu, mkumbuche vila Bwana navyoyawalohole wanhu wa Isilaeli na kuwalavya kuli isi ya Misili, ila hamba nakawadumya wala nawowali hambe wakunde. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Mkumbuchile wala wahilisi wa kilanga nawaganile wawe na ukulu kusinda nawowawele nawo, ahyo, nawaleka honhu hawo howaganigwe kikala. Nguluwi nakawawika honhu hawele na jiza na kuwawoha kwa minyololo mazuwa gose leka watagusigwe zuwa yila ng'hulu. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Mkumbuche kahi Sodoma na Gomola kahi na miji ja hafungo hake, wenyeng'haye wa aho nawadita kota wala wahilisi wa kilanga, nawadita ung'hondwa na kiditila mbuli mlukuli zilingulemezwa, nawapegwa utaguso wa chiluli mazuwa gose ne kuduma, leka iwe ikanyo kwa wanhu weng'ha.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Ahyo ndo vyowawele wanhu awa. Kulota kwa hewo kwanguwalongoza kuli kuziditila wavu ng'huli za hewo wawo, nakubeza ludali lwa Nguluwi na kuviliga vilumbigwe vikulu vya kilanga. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Naye Mikaeli, yumwe wa wahilisi wakulu wa kilanga, nahaditile ahyo. Kwa kula kitwanza hali heye na Limazoga kwa chiwalo cha lukuli lwa Musa, Mikaeli nahajezile kulitagusa Limazoga kwa maligo, ila nakalonga, “Mkulu yuye nayakunghanuchile!” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Ila wanhu awa wanguliga choneche chohawachizelele, wosumigwa kwa mbuli zizila zowazizelele kwa vihendo vyao, kota vyojivizelele migongolo jiwele hela luhala. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Mane wawo! Wanhu awo wawinza vihendo vivila vya Kaini. Kwa chiwalo cha sendi, weyinjiza kuli nongwa yiyila ya Balaamu. Wabelenhuka kota Kola vyoyabelenhuche na wasumigwa kota heye vyoyasumigwe. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Kwa iyowe lyawo lilihela nyhala na kwa kiganilila wawo, wanhu awo ndo walinguwaditila vibi mnvina ya hemwe yomlingudita kwa igano. Wafanda kota ng'hungugu iwele hela nhonya ilingwezuligwa na mbeho. Hewo wafanda kota migodi jilagaze mahamba johambe jilele mafuza, jibagame ng'hatu, jing'humbuligwe. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Wanhu awo wafanda kota nhigu ng'hulu ya bahali na madito ga hewo ga soni gangoneka kota ifulo. Hewo wafanda kota nhondwe ziwele ngulubaluba ziwele ziwichilwa mazuwa gose honhu ha jiza ng'hulu.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Naye Henoki, yawele ndo sekulu wa saba kulawa Adamu, nakalagula ahi kwa wanhu awo, “Muhulichize! Mkulu kokuya hamwe na wahilisi wa kilanga wa heye welile wenji wohambe wawazigwe, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />kuwatagusa wanhu weng'ha na kuwagaza weng'ha wohambe wamnojeze Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha madito ga hewo geng'ha gehile gowaditile ne kumdumba Nguluwi na kwa chiwalo cha ulonzi weng'ha wihile ula wanhu wehile nawamlijile!”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Wanhu awa ndo wawele ngung'ung'uta mazuwa gose na kupala nongwa za wanji na kuwatogola wanhu wanji ng'hatu kwa chiwalo cha kupegwa vinhu.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukanyigwa na malajizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Ila hemwe moloko, mkumbuchile gala gomlonjelwe aho katali na watumigwa wa Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Nawawalonjelani, “Mazuwa ga kuduma, wolawila wanhu walinguwinza maya ga wanhu wohambe wamdumbe Nguluwi, nawo, wowaseka hemwe kota wapoka.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Awo wanhu wehile ndo wawele nguwambuza hemwe mibagule, wanhu wa maya ga isi, wawele hela Muhe wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Ila hemwe, ndilinguwaganani heni, mizenje mwemwe kuli makundo ga hemwe ganojile ng'hatu. Mlande kwa ludali lwa Muhe Yelile <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />na kupona kuli igano lya Nguluwi, mumbeteza Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu yawele na isungu lya heye, kowagalalilani ukomu wa mazuwa gose ne kuduma.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Muwonele isungu wanhu wawele na lunhwinhwi, <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Muwalohole kwa kuwanyasula kulawa mchiluli. Ila kwa wanji muwe na isungu hamwe na kilolela, mzudila mbaka na nguwo za hewo za maya gehile.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kangumtogola Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Kwa heye yadahile kuwemilila hemwe mleche kugwa kuli gehile na kuwegala hemwe kwa usangalalo mbaka kumwando kwa ukulu wa heye. <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Kwa heye yawele yaliyeng'ha Nguluwi, Mlohozi wa hetwe, uwe ukulu na kuzeleka ng'hatu na ludali na mong'ho kukolela Yesu Kilistu Mkulu wa hetwe, kulawa mazuwa gose na sambi na mbaka mazuwa gose galinguya! Ena.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>